From 5fcaa95a1012c9562a3e11a89e927d169ae7d0a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.net>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:27:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dhcpd: start only on an interface with a link

No adapter or no cable: no DHCP and no console lines. After link-up
dhcpd asks without pause; with no lease after 60 s it prints one line
and then asks quietly every 30 s. A link that goes down and up again
(cable plugged in again, adapter added) starts over (redox-rpi #560).
---
 Cargo.lock        |  39 ++++++++++++++++++
 dhcpd/src/main.rs | 100 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 118 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
